title: "Intel Scene Classification: CNN vs VGG16 vs Bagged Ensemble"
abstract: "Image classification on the Intel Image Classification dataset (6 scene classes), comparing a baseline CNN, fine-tuned VGG16 transfer learning, and a bagged-ensemble of Dense heads (~93% test accuracy), with Grad-CAM visualizations and misclassification analysis."
